warning[adding-field-with-default]: adding a generated column rewrites the table under an `access exclusive` lock
  ╭▸ 
2 │ alter table t add column d int generated always as (x + 1);
  │                                ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
  │
  ╰ help: add the column as nullable, backfill existing rows, and add a trigger to update the column on write instead
